  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-16T12:16:36.265738Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-16T12:42:20.623716Z",
  "totalBlocks": 39,
  "translatedBlocks": 39,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3421e52cb591329c",
      "translationZh": "AI 开发者希望能够选择最新的大语言模型（LLM）架构及专用变体，用于 AI 智能体和其他应用，但应对这些多样性可能会拖慢测试和部署流水线。尤其是，为了在不同 LLM 和服务需求下实现最佳性能，管理和优化不同的推理软件框架是一项耗时的工作，成为将高性能 AI 应用交付到最终用户手中的瓶颈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c0fbb0d25ea783e",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA AI 客户和生态系统合作伙伴利用 NVIDIA NIM 推理微服务，简化在 NVIDIA 加速基础设施上部署最新 AI 模型的流程，这些模型包括来自 NVIDIA、Meta、Mistral AI、Google 以及数百家其他创新模型开发者的 LLM、多模态模型和领域专用模型。我们已经看到，客户和合作伙伴通过一种简化、可靠的模型部署方式，更快地实现了更多创新。今天，我们很高兴能让 Hugging Face 上超过 100,000 个 LLM 得以通过 NIM 快速、可靠地部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "814d00997c2d27c8",
      "translationZh": "通过单个 NIM 微服务部署广泛的 LLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dcfb0120b53a0d0e",
      "translationZh": "NIM 现在提供单个 docker 容器，可用于部署由 NVIDIA 和社区的领先推理框架支持的广泛 LLM，这些框架包括 NVIDIA TensorRT-LLM、vLLM 和 SGLang。当向 NIM 容器提供一个 LLM 时，它会执行多个部署和性能优化步骤，无需手动配置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db29d75913911c9c",
      "translationZh": "LLM 适配阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ccad2aa1dc8270f",
      "translationZh": "NIM 执行的操作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e25fbea4c303b4f7",
      "translationZh": "模型分析",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63fa8cd20918b26c",
      "translationZh": "NIM 会自动识别模型的格式，包括 Hugging Face 模型、TensorRT-LLM 检查点或预构建的 TensorRT-LLM 引擎，以确保兼容性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee82f4ad4058450b",
      "translationZh": "架构与量化检测",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8782480ac82aebab",
      "translationZh": "它会识别模型的架构（例如 Llama、Mistral）和量化格式（例如 FP16、FP8、INT4）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dec4a5e7a5273b1b",
      "translationZh": "后端选择",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7762df9d9e541567",
      "translationZh": "根据这一分析，NIM 会选择一个推理后端（NVIDIA TensorRT-LLM、vLLM 或 SGLang）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1dc366afc29ffc8",
      "translationZh": "性能配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "afcde4520a8a8e9f",
      "translationZh": "NIM 会针对所选模型和后端应用预先配置的设置，然后启动推理服务器，从而减少手动调优工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe408e81a1df84f6",
      "translationZh": "表 1. NVIDIA NIM LLM 适配阶段及功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69468e05350020b9",
      "translationZh": "单个 NIM 容器支持常见的 LLM 权重格式，包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "04b9b1f304b4d090",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Transformers 检查点：LLM 可以直接从包含 .safetensors 文件的 Hugging Face 仓库部署，无需进行复杂的转换。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0f14e616d75f01ae",
      "translationZh": "GGUF 检查点：对于受支持的模型架构，其量化 GGUF 检查点可以直接从 HuggingFace 或本地下载的文件部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7b9948c5cf4bfd10",
      "translationZh": "TensorRT-LLM 检查点：可以部署打包在 trtllm_ckpt 目录中、针对 TensorRT-LLM 优化的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f1ba31cb95da3f53",
      "translationZh": "TensorRT-LLM 引擎：可以使用 trtllm_engine 目录中预构建的 TensorRT-LLM 引擎，以在 NVIDIA GPU 上实现峰值性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d00eca1bae674280",
      "translationZh": "入门",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52deb02b6a310f1a",
      "translationZh": "要使用 NIM，请确保你的环境具备 NVIDIA GPU 及适当的驱动程序（CUDA 12.1+）、已安装 Docker、用于获取 NIM Docker 镜像的 NVIDIA NGC 账户和 API 密钥，以及用于需要身份验证的模型的 Hugging Face 账户和 API 令牌。有关环境先决条件的更多信息，请参阅 NIM 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd1e083912e94ddc",
      "translationZh": "环境设置包括设置环境变量和创建持久化缓存目录。请确保 nim_cache 目录具有正确的 Unix 权限，最好由启动 Docker 容器的同一个 Unix 用户拥有，以避免权限问题。命令使用 -u $(id -u) 来处理这一点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74627bd0817c7a25",
      "translationZh": "为方便使用，我们将一些常用信息存储在环境变量中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f8220202451acf10",
      "translationZh": "示例 1：部署模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ed7178b6ab79df9",
      "translationZh": "下面以 Codestral-22B 为例，演示如何部署来自 Hugging Face 的 LLM：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "824c11468095b00d",
      "translationZh": "对于已下载到本地的模型，将 NIM_MODEL_NAME 指向模型路径，并挂载该目录：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60ef3a22e6cc3f17",
      "translationZh": "在部署模型时，你可以随时查看输出日志，了解 NIM 在模型部署过程中做出了哪些选择。部署后的模型可通过 http://localhost:8000 访问，API 端点位于 http://localhost:8000/docs。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bef1ecbc56d458ad",
      "translationZh": "底层引擎还提供了其他参数。你可以在容器中运行 nim-run --help，查看这些参数的完整列表，如下所示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2d697e8ed8560219",
      "translationZh": "示例 2：指定后端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "304dc978fe089fad",
      "translationZh": "要查看兼容的后端或选择某个特定后端，请使用 list-model-profiles：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d8932ecdbb36fd7",
      "translationZh": "此命令会显示兼容的配置，其中也包括适用于 LoRA 适配器的配置。要使用 vLLM 等特定后端进行部署，请根据 list-model-profiles 提供的输出，设置 NIM_MODEL_PROFILE 环境变量：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "257e95a579cfcf61",
      "translationZh": "示例 3：量化模型部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "390102510ad0f444",
      "translationZh": "NIM 让量化模型的部署更加便捷。它会自动检测量化格式（例如 GGUF、AWQ），并通过标准部署命令选择合适的后端：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbbb4ea89c8781c2",
      "translationZh": "对于高级用户，NIM 提供了通过环境变量进行自定义配置的功能，例如使用 NIM_MAX_MODEL_LEN 设置上下文长度。对于大型 LLM，NIM_TENSOR_PARALLEL_SIZE 可实现多 GPU 部署。请确保向 Docker 传入 --shm-size=<shared memory size>，以支持多 GPU 通信。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "246e627ad8f2e760",
      "translationZh": "NIM 容器支持 NVIDIA TensorRT-LLM、vLLM 和 SGLang 所支持的众多 LLM，包括 Hugging Face 上的热门 LLM 及其专用变体。有关受支持 LLM 的更多详细信息，请参阅文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f7b276a923e229c5",
      "translationZh": "携手 Hugging Face 和 NVIDIA 构建",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0bf0c2ca4ca4772",
      "translationZh": "NIM 旨在简化 NVIDIA 加速基础设施上的 AI 模型部署，帮助高性能 AI 构建者和企业 AI 团队加快创新，并缩短实现价值所需的时间。我们期待 Hugging Face 社区的参与和反馈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe510fa03e245d95",
      "translationZh": "前往 build.nvidia.com，在 NVIDIA 托管的计算环境中通过开发者示例开始上手。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
